{"about_the_game":"<strong>Silicon Girl</strong> is an erotic first-person interactive game focused on customization, characters, and relationship development.<br><br>You receive a prototype of a \u201cSilicon Girl\u201d \u2014 an experimental android companion named <strong>Lucy</strong>.<br><br>Customize her appearance, unlock new looks, hairstyles, and outfits, and earn gears \u2014 an in-game currency used to expand customization options.<br><br>Each scene consumes battery charge. When the energy runs out, Lucy can be recharged so you can continue exploring the content without restarting.<br><br>With the recent update, a new character has been added \u2014 <strong>Emily</strong>.<br>More shy. More human. More... complex. Her presence unlocks new scenes and reveals the story from a different perspective.<br><br>As you progress, you unlock new interactions, scenes, and customization elements, shaping your own experience and choosing how to develop what\u2019s happening.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20 unique character looks<br></li><li>13 hairstyles + color customization (10 shades)<br></li><li>18 customizable outfits<br></li><li>17 body morphs for advanced customization<br></li><li>32 interactive animations<br></li><li>New character: Emily (10 scenes)<br></li><li>Battery system with recharge mechanic<br></li><li>Gear currency \u2014 spend it on customization<br></li><li>Additional mini-games unlocking bonus content<br></li><li>Daytime and weather control (morning, day, evening, night)</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025520/ca6e0e769af257db43b188eb610fb4023e00045c.jpg"},{"name":"Hair Protocol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025520/164c89a6caebc95092c5448cc30c94c23737f56e.jpg"},{"name":"Full Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/